\pard\sa200\sl250\slmult1\b\fs28 1. Project Overview\b0\fs22\par
\par
Move & Groove is a Next.js mobility application for athletes. It combines:\par
\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab AI-generated mobility routines\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab self-screening and movement assessment\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab readiness and session check-ins\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab saved routines and results history\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab recovery sessions\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab weekly planning and gated Pro features\par
\par
The product is designed around a dark editorial aesthetic with high-contrast typography, inline styles, and a custom SVG icon system.\par
\par
