\pard\sa200\sl250\slmult1\b\fs28 4. Current Architecture\b0\fs22\par
\par
\pard\sa120\sl220\slmult1\f1\fs18\cb1
Browser\par
  -> Next.js App Router pages\par
    -> Supabase browser client for auth + user data\par
    -> API routes for server-side generation / protected writes\par
\par
Core user flows\par
  Auth\par
    -> Supabase Auth\par
    -> profiles table lookup for Pro state\par
\par
  Quiz / Recovery\par
    -> POST /api/routines/generate\par
    -> Anthropic model\par
    -> Save routines + routine_items to Supabase\par
    -> Store generated routine in localStorage\par
    -> Render in /routine\par
\par
  Screening\par
    -> calculate regional scores client-side\par
    -> save questionnaire + results to Supabase\par
\par
  Battery\par
    -> score movement tests client-side\par
    -> save test_results to Supabase\par
\par
  Readiness / Session Check-in / Programs preflight\par
    -> readiness question model in src/lib/readiness.ts\par
    -> save readiness_logs to Supabase\par
\par
  Results / Programs\par
    -> read prior user rows from Supabase\par
    -> derive summary cards and recommendations client-side\par
\pard\sa160\sl240\slmult1\f0\fs22
\par
