\pard\sa200\sl250\slmult1\b\fs28 9. Core Business Logic\b0\fs22\par
\par
\pard\sa180\sl240\slmult1\b\fs24 Routine generation\b0\fs22\par
\par
Routine generation is split into phases:\par
\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab `prep`\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab `release`\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab `activation`\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab `range`\par
\par
Recovery mode uses:\par
\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab `goal = flexibility`\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab `includeFoamRoll = true`\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab focus areas of `hips`, `shoulders`, and `spine`\par
\par
\pard\sa180\sl240\slmult1\b\fs24 Readiness logic\b0\fs22\par
\par
Source: `src/lib/readiness.ts`\par
\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab 5 questions\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab each scored 1-4\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab converted to a 0-100 readiness score\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab score maps to label + recommendation\par
\par
\pard\sa180\sl240\slmult1\b\fs24 Screening logic\b0\fs22\par
\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab 11 total questions\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab regions: hips, shoulders, spine\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab scores normalized to percentage\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab overall score derived client-side and saved\par
\par
\pard\sa180\sl240\slmult1\b\fs24 Battery logic\b0\fs22\par
\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab 5 movement tests\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab each scored 0-3\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab total out of 15\par
\par
\pard\sa180\sl240\slmult1\b\fs24 Programs logic\b0\fs22\par
\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab reads routine history from Supabase\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab builds derived weekly calendar locally\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab builds 4-week block summary locally\par
\pard\li360\sa80 \95\tab includes a readiness overlay before sending the user to `/quiz`\par
